#
# The example audio service runs as two processes, the core HAL and the effects
# HAL, and both carry this domain. The core HAL transacts with the effects HAL's
# binder (the interface-descriptor transaction on a binder it received from a
# client), which the domain must allow to itself. Without the rule every audio
# stream open logs a denial, and the audit rate limit hides how many.
binder_call(hal_audio_default, hal_audio_default)
